1
00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:03,000
♪

2
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:12,810
[wind blowing]

3
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:17,140
-[creaking]
-[Coco gasps softly]

4
00:00:19,810 --> 00:00:21,310
Is that the wind?

5
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:26,150
-[QIFREY] Ah, you're awake.
-Huh?

6
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:27,860
[Qifrey grunts softly]

7
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:30,610
I took the liberty of hailing us
a Pegasus Carriage.

8
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:31,660
[COCO] Huh?

9
00:00:31,950 --> 00:00:33,120
You must be chilly,

10
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:35,030
flying so high
in your bedclothes.

11
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:37,410
Our ride's almost over.

12
00:00:38,710 --> 00:00:40,750
-Oh, look there.
-[Coco gasps]

13
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:42,380
Our destination.

14
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:43,790
[Coco gasps]

15
00:00:44,290 --> 00:00:45,750
[gasps]

16
00:00:46,510 --> 00:00:48,220
♪

17
00:00:51,970 --> 00:00:54,180
[QIFREY] That is my atelier.

18
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:57,020
And your new place of study.

19
00:00:58,310 --> 00:01:00,690
[♪ opening theme song playing]

20
00:02:28,570 --> 00:02:31,490
THE SCHOOL OF THE GRASSLAND

21
00:02:31,530 --> 00:02:33,490
[QIFREY] Don't worry
about your house.

22
00:02:33,530 --> 00:02:35,910
I planted Guard Briar seeds
all around it.

23
00:02:36,570 --> 00:02:38,740
They'll grow quickly,
and as they do,

24
00:02:38,780 --> 00:02:40,910
they'll form
a protective barrier.

25
00:02:40,950 --> 00:02:43,330
The spell that petrified
your house,

26
00:02:43,370 --> 00:02:45,330
is presently unknown to us.

27
00:02:45,370 --> 00:02:47,210
Best to keep
any careless visitors

28
00:02:47,250 --> 00:02:48,460
from getting too close.

29
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:55,380
Well, then...

30
00:02:55,430 --> 00:02:56,590
Uh?

31
00:02:57,300 --> 00:02:58,600
Coco?

32
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:05,140
What's the matter?

33
00:03:05,180 --> 00:03:07,060
[crying]
I promised my mother

34
00:03:07,100 --> 00:03:10,400
that I would never leave her
all alone,

35
00:03:10,440 --> 00:03:11,860
and now, I...

36
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,740
Oh, dear.

37
00:03:18,200 --> 00:03:20,580
Please don't blame yourself.

38
00:03:20,950 --> 00:03:22,330
You didn't know.

39
00:03:26,330 --> 00:03:28,750
[door closes]

40
00:03:29,580 --> 00:03:31,210
[footsteps]

41
00:03:31,500 --> 00:03:32,750
♪

42
00:03:35,130 --> 00:03:37,340
[QIFREY] Here,
to wash your face.

43
00:03:37,930 --> 00:03:41,350
Let your tears fall behind you,
and look forward.

44
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:46,520
As of today,
this shall be your home.

45
00:03:47,770 --> 00:03:49,230
[Coco gasps]

46
00:03:53,780 --> 00:03:55,610
[COCO] Uh...

47
00:03:56,860 --> 00:04:00,160
-[COCO] Um, what is this?
-[QIFREY] Hm?

48
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:01,620
Why, it's water.

49
00:04:01,660 --> 00:04:03,490
Oh, right.

50
00:04:03,540 --> 00:04:05,910
How could I forget?
You'll need a change of clothes.

51
00:04:05,950 --> 00:04:07,830
[COCO] Water isn't usually
so round and floaty.

52
00:04:07,870 --> 00:04:09,540
-I'll be back in a flash.
-[gasps]

53
00:04:09,580 --> 00:04:11,540
Wait, could you explain

54
00:04:11,590 --> 00:04:13,590
how I'm supposed
to use this first?

55
00:04:14,300 --> 00:04:16,090
Mr. Qifrey?

56
00:04:18,180 --> 00:04:20,180
Touching magic
I know nothing about

57
00:04:20,220 --> 00:04:21,760
is a little scary now.

58
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:23,720
[GIRL] Aw, don't be scared!

59
00:04:24,140 --> 00:04:26,890
Far as spells go,
that one's pretty simple.

60
00:04:27,140 --> 00:04:28,350
[chuckles]

61
00:04:29,270 --> 00:04:32,190
I can tell you all about it
if you want me to!

62
00:04:33,820 --> 00:04:34,900
[Coco gasps softly]

63
00:04:34,980 --> 00:04:37,400
What you've got there
is a Vapor Bubble.

64
00:04:37,440 --> 00:04:40,240
It's a kind of magic that takes
moisture out of the air

65
00:04:40,280 --> 00:04:41,620
and turns it into water.

66
00:04:41,660 --> 00:04:43,160
Hold out your hands for me.

67
00:04:43,200 --> 00:04:44,450
Here! Go on!

68
00:04:45,620 --> 00:04:47,750
You tilt the lower tray
like this,

69
00:04:47,790 --> 00:04:49,620
and the water comes flowing out!

70
00:04:49,660 --> 00:04:53,330
Wow, amazing.
Thanks so much.

71
00:04:53,380 --> 00:04:55,500
-Thank you!
-[COCO] Huh?

72
00:04:55,550 --> 00:04:58,630
I always love it so when
people tell me "thank you."

73
00:04:58,670 --> 00:05:00,630
So thank you for your thanks!

74
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:02,760
[COCO] Oh, I see.

75
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:05,760
Well, thank you, again.

76
00:05:05,810 --> 00:05:06,930
And thank you!

77
00:05:06,970 --> 00:05:08,640
That one's
for thanking me again!

78
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:11,270
Thank you too!
Thank you for thanking me

79
00:05:11,310 --> 00:05:13,190
-for thanking you.
-[GIRL 2] Stop responding,

80
00:05:13,230 --> 00:05:15,020
-just ignore her.
-[both gasp]

81
00:05:16,320 --> 00:05:19,240
She'll tire herself out
and give up.

82
00:05:19,280 --> 00:05:21,240
Richeh, you're so mean!

83
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:23,320
I was actually being
very helpful,

84
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,700
I'll have you know.

85
00:05:24,740 --> 00:05:25,950
[Coco gasps]

86
00:05:25,990 --> 00:05:27,910
[COCO] The pen and ink.

87
00:05:28,910 --> 00:05:31,710
Would the two of you
happen to be witches?

88
00:05:31,750 --> 00:05:33,250
We're apprentices.

89
00:05:33,290 --> 00:05:35,670
Students studying
with Master Qifrey.

90
00:05:35,710 --> 00:05:38,210
Wait, if you're asking,
then are you not?

91
00:05:38,260 --> 00:05:39,420
So what are you?

92
00:05:39,460 --> 00:05:41,470
Are you the same age
as Richeh and I?

93
00:05:41,510 --> 00:05:43,180
Are you? Looks like it.

94
00:05:43,220 --> 00:05:45,300
And what atelier
did you come here from?

95
00:05:45,340 --> 00:05:46,640
[Coco exhales nervously]

96
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:49,100
Well, uh, I think
it's still a little early

97
00:05:49,140 --> 00:05:50,600
to call myself a student.

98
00:05:50,640 --> 00:05:52,390
The truth is, before yesterday,

99
00:05:52,440 --> 00:05:54,980
I had never drawn
a spell in my life.

100
00:05:55,020 --> 00:05:57,270
But I do live here
starting today.

101
00:05:58,780 --> 00:06:00,280
[BOTH] Oh...

102
00:06:01,070 --> 00:06:02,450
What is it?

103
00:06:02,490 --> 00:06:03,860
So it's you.

104
00:06:03,910 --> 00:06:05,660
You're the one
that rumor's about?

105
00:06:05,700 --> 00:06:08,040
What do you mean?
What rumor?

106
00:06:08,950 --> 00:06:10,450
[exclaims softly]

107
00:06:10,580 --> 00:06:12,410
♪

108
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:19,920
[GIRL] People have been
talking about an Outsider

109
00:06:19,960 --> 00:06:22,420
who made use of forbidden magic,

110
00:06:22,470 --> 00:06:25,180
and was then allowed
to become an apprentice

111
00:06:25,220 --> 00:06:27,390
with her memories intact.

112
00:06:28,100 --> 00:06:29,930
-[QIFREY] Coco?
-[Coco gasps]

113
00:06:31,100 --> 00:06:32,430
Are you all right?

114
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,810
I think so.

115
00:06:33,850 --> 00:06:36,100
Looks as though you've all been
getting acquainted

116
00:06:36,150 --> 00:06:37,270
with each other.

117
00:06:37,310 --> 00:06:39,520
Richeh, Tetia,
once you're finished helping

118
00:06:39,570 --> 00:06:42,030
with the morning chores,
will you go study in your rooms?

119
00:06:42,070 --> 00:06:43,820
-All right!
-Hm.

120
00:06:44,490 --> 00:06:47,490
[QIFREY] Here. It's what
all my students wear.

121
00:06:47,530 --> 00:06:48,740
[Coco exclaims softly]

122
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,750
Please don't worry.

123
00:06:51,790 --> 00:06:53,580
I will explain everything.

124
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:55,580
[birds chirping]

125
00:06:56,170 --> 00:06:58,170
[QIFREY]
Looks like a perfect fit.

126
00:06:58,670 --> 00:06:59,920
[Coco exhales softly]

127
00:07:00,460 --> 00:07:03,880
And now, I shall share with you
the history of magic.

128
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:06,010
[Coco gasps softly] Hm.

129
00:07:07,510 --> 00:07:09,140
[QIFREY] Long ago...

130
00:07:09,180 --> 00:07:11,640
magic was a part
of ordinary life.

131
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:13,270
[scribbling]

132
00:07:13,310 --> 00:07:15,230
All that one needed to use it

133
00:07:15,270 --> 00:07:18,230
was a special ink
and a set of patterns.

134
00:07:19,270 --> 00:07:20,690
♪

135
00:07:23,610 --> 00:07:25,780
[QIFREY] It was a simple,
familiar tool,

136
00:07:25,820 --> 00:07:28,570
available to anyone
and everyone.

137
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:31,990
Yet at the same time,

138
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:34,700
it was a constant source
of conflict.

139
00:07:34,750 --> 00:07:36,500
[faint clamoring]

140
00:07:36,540 --> 00:07:39,880
[QIFREY] When mankind holds
the power to do anything,

141
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:41,670
"anything" is what they do.

142
00:07:41,710 --> 00:07:44,710
Many horrific spells
were created.

143
00:07:48,840 --> 00:07:51,510
The few good souls
who remained in the world

144
00:07:51,550 --> 00:07:53,600
renounced war and strife,

145
00:07:53,640 --> 00:07:55,930
and banded together
as witches.

146
00:07:55,980 --> 00:07:58,850
They stole away
humanity's memory of magic,

147
00:07:58,900 --> 00:08:00,980
letting it only be known
to their disciples,

148
00:08:01,020 --> 00:08:02,900
who were sworn to protect it.

149
00:08:04,190 --> 00:08:06,570
That was the Day of the Pact.

150
00:08:07,030 --> 00:08:08,610
Since then,
people have believed

151
00:08:08,660 --> 00:08:12,120
that magic is a power
only a chosen few can wield.

152
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:13,990
If the truth came to light,

153
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:16,830
the world would fall
into chaos once again.

154
00:08:17,830 --> 00:08:20,130
You see, that's why
we've taken such care

155
00:08:20,170 --> 00:08:21,540
to preserve the secret.

156
00:08:21,580 --> 00:08:23,840
And why your story
has traveled so quickly.

157
00:08:24,550 --> 00:08:25,760
I'm sorry.

158
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:26,920
No.

159
00:08:26,970 --> 00:08:29,090
I've brought
all this upon myself.

160
00:08:29,470 --> 00:08:30,640
But...

161
00:08:31,260 --> 00:08:33,100
What is "forbidden magic"?

162
00:08:34,510 --> 00:08:36,810
Magic drawn
during the age of war,

163
00:08:36,850 --> 00:08:39,440
and banished upon
the Day of the Pact.

164
00:08:40,190 --> 00:08:42,150
Magic for hurting people.

165
00:08:42,190 --> 00:08:43,230
[Coco gasps]

166
00:08:44,690 --> 00:08:46,650
[COCO] Teach me, I beg you!

167
00:08:46,690 --> 00:08:48,820
Let me learn about
this Forbidden Magic!

168
00:08:48,860 --> 00:08:51,110
I need to understand it!

169
00:08:51,740 --> 00:08:54,080
I can't go on not knowing.

170
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:56,200
It's too frightening to bear!

171
00:08:57,120 --> 00:09:00,540
Normally, I tell my students
not to rush themselves,

172
00:09:00,580 --> 00:09:02,670
but I fear
it's too late for that.

173
00:09:05,300 --> 00:09:06,590
Come with me.

174
00:09:11,430 --> 00:09:13,550
There are any number
of forbidden spells

175
00:09:13,590 --> 00:09:15,640
I could list.
But to keep it simple,

176
00:09:16,350 --> 00:09:17,930
it's like so...

177
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:21,230
Any spell cast directly
upon the human body

178
00:09:21,270 --> 00:09:23,060
is utterly prohibited.

179
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:26,860
This includes transformation,
age alteration,

180
00:09:26,900 --> 00:09:30,280
teleportation without the use
of doors or conveyances.

181
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:32,780
Manipulating thoughts
or emotions,

182
00:09:32,820 --> 00:09:35,330
doing harm to a person,
or healing them.

183
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:38,290
There is but one exception.

184
00:09:38,830 --> 00:09:41,000
Erasing people's memories?

185
00:09:41,040 --> 00:09:42,710
[QIFREY] Precisely...

186
00:09:42,750 --> 00:09:46,840
Therefore, most spells
are cast on tools.

187
00:09:49,050 --> 00:09:51,430
Like carriages, or lamps.

188
00:09:52,800 --> 00:09:54,760
[gasps] Wow.

189
00:09:58,010 --> 00:10:01,850
Or even windows,
such as this one.

190
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:23,080
It's a lake!

191
00:10:23,540 --> 00:10:26,880
But we were surrounded by hills
just a moment ago.

192
00:10:26,920 --> 00:10:28,920
[QIFREY] This is a Windowway.

193
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:32,420
It links two round windows
bearing the same pattern.

194
00:10:32,470 --> 00:10:34,720
Do you see that building
in the distance?

195
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:37,470
The Tower of Tomes.

196
00:10:37,510 --> 00:10:39,510
Every time a book on magic
is written,

197
00:10:39,560 --> 00:10:41,480
a copy instantly appears there,

198
00:10:41,520 --> 00:10:43,890
to ensure the knowledge within
is never lost.

199
00:10:43,940 --> 00:10:44,890
[Coco gasps]

200
00:10:44,940 --> 00:10:46,770
They'll have the picture book.

201
00:10:46,810 --> 00:10:48,060
Please take me there!

202
00:10:48,110 --> 00:10:49,900
I'll search nonstop
till I find it!

203
00:10:49,940 --> 00:10:50,980
Slow down.

204
00:10:51,030 --> 00:10:52,940
[water gushing]

205
00:10:52,990 --> 00:10:55,240
[rumbling]

206
00:11:00,620 --> 00:11:02,580
-[Qifrey grunts]
-[Coco exclaims]

207
00:11:02,620 --> 00:11:04,330
[Coco groans]

208
00:11:05,710 --> 00:11:07,000
♪

209
00:11:07,580 --> 00:11:10,630
[chuckles]
That's the Librarians' Trial.

210
00:11:11,340 --> 00:11:14,260
The Tower of Tomes is guarded
by four librarians,

211
00:11:14,300 --> 00:11:16,430
and only witches
who overcome their trials

212
00:11:16,470 --> 00:11:18,050
are allowed to enter.

213
00:11:18,510 --> 00:11:21,890
So if you wish to visit,
you're going to have to study.

214
00:11:22,850 --> 00:11:23,890
Coco...

215
00:11:24,520 --> 00:11:26,980
Hearing of your
eagerness to learn

216
00:11:27,020 --> 00:11:29,060
truly filled me with happiness.

217
00:11:29,900 --> 00:11:32,030
And the fear you feel
is natural.

218
00:11:32,690 --> 00:11:33,780
But...

219
00:11:35,030 --> 00:11:37,740
the spells which have
not been forbidden...

220
00:11:42,450 --> 00:11:46,120
are the ones that bring
happiness to people's lives.

221
00:11:46,500 --> 00:11:47,960
Don't you think

222
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:50,420
you'd rather learn about
a gentler kind of magic?

223
00:11:50,460 --> 00:11:52,500
-[Coco gasps]
-[QIFREY] What do you say?

224
00:11:52,550 --> 00:11:53,510
[COCO] Huh?

225
00:11:53,550 --> 00:11:55,300
Are you interested?

226
00:11:55,800 --> 00:11:56,970
Yes.

227
00:11:57,010 --> 00:11:59,430
Of course, Master Qifrey.

228
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:01,300
[bird cawing]

229
00:12:03,010 --> 00:12:04,720
This will be your room.

230
00:12:07,730 --> 00:12:09,940
Apparently Agott's not around.

231
00:12:09,980 --> 00:12:11,310
[COCO] Who's Agott?

232
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:13,400
[QIFREY]
She's your new roommate.

233
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:18,610
[Coco exclaims softly]

234
00:12:19,110 --> 00:12:21,740
[QIFREY] There's one workspace,
which you'll share,

235
00:12:21,780 --> 00:12:23,540
and two bedrooms.

236
00:12:23,580 --> 00:12:25,160
[Coco gasps]

237
00:12:25,870 --> 00:12:28,210
[QIFREY] They're down the stairs
in the back.

238
00:12:28,250 --> 00:12:30,170
Don't worry, the doors do lock.

239
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:33,250
Get some rest if you like.

240
00:12:33,290 --> 00:12:34,920
I had better be on my way.

241
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:36,920
Call me if you need anything.

242
00:12:39,510 --> 00:12:40,760
[footsteps]

243
00:12:47,390 --> 00:12:49,730
Hello, this is Qifrey.

244
00:12:49,770 --> 00:12:51,350
Coco's settling in nicely.

245
00:12:51,400 --> 00:12:53,730
Thank you for approving
her apprenticeship.

246
00:12:54,900 --> 00:12:56,190
Yes.

247
00:12:56,820 --> 00:12:57,900
No.

248
00:12:58,320 --> 00:12:59,650
Nothing on the book yet.

249
00:12:59,700 --> 00:13:02,240
She may need a bit of time
to get adjusted.

250
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:04,740
[Coco exclaims]

251
00:13:04,780 --> 00:13:07,950
[COCO] So this is what
a witch's room looks like.

252
00:13:09,290 --> 00:13:11,540
[AGOTT]
That's my side of the desk.

253
00:13:11,580 --> 00:13:13,080
[Coco gasps]

254
00:13:23,220 --> 00:13:25,800
Out of the way. I'm landing.

255
00:13:25,850 --> 00:13:28,020
Oh, I'm sorry.

256
00:13:34,940 --> 00:13:36,570
[exclaims softly]

257
00:13:37,940 --> 00:13:39,360
Nice to meet you!

258
00:13:39,400 --> 00:13:41,950
-Agott, right? I'm Coco...
-I know.

259
00:13:42,410 --> 00:13:44,870
The famous Outsider, right?

260
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:48,370
I understand you'll be
joining us as an apprentice.

261
00:13:49,250 --> 00:13:50,500
Oh, right.

262
00:13:50,540 --> 00:13:52,620
Sorry to hear
about your mother.

263
00:13:52,670 --> 00:13:54,670
Thanks. That's very kind.

264
00:13:54,710 --> 00:13:56,710
[AGOTT] Because of you...

265
00:13:58,840 --> 00:14:01,630
she'll never be flesh
and blood again, will she?

266
00:14:01,680 --> 00:14:03,010
[Coco inhales sharply]

267
00:14:03,050 --> 00:14:05,680
The reason I'm here
is to save her, if I can.

268
00:14:06,180 --> 00:14:07,720
By becoming a witch...

269
00:14:10,310 --> 00:14:12,140
This is what my life has been.

270
00:14:12,190 --> 00:14:15,150
Drawing casting seals
till my fingers turned black.

271
00:14:15,190 --> 00:14:17,520
Working and working
to pass the tests,

272
00:14:17,570 --> 00:14:20,190
so that one day
I could become an apprentice.

273
00:14:20,820 --> 00:14:23,150
You don't know
the first thing about it.

274
00:14:23,200 --> 00:14:25,070
There's no way
an Outsider like you

275
00:14:25,110 --> 00:14:26,410
will ever be a witch.

276
00:14:26,450 --> 00:14:27,830
♪

277
00:14:29,370 --> 00:14:30,750
No, I don't know.

278
00:14:30,790 --> 00:14:33,080
But I have drawn spells!

279
00:14:33,500 --> 00:14:35,080
I have to at least try!

280
00:14:35,120 --> 00:14:37,290
All right, then prove yourself.

281
00:14:37,340 --> 00:14:38,710
Your test starts tomorrow--

282
00:14:38,750 --> 00:14:40,670
[TETIA] Agott! Coco!

283
00:14:40,710 --> 00:14:42,720
Food time!

284
00:14:43,170 --> 00:14:46,090
-Let's go!
-[stomach growls]

285
00:14:47,800 --> 00:14:49,060
[COCO] Excuse me!

286
00:14:50,560 --> 00:14:52,600
I could eat a Pegasus.

287
00:14:52,640 --> 00:14:53,770
I could, too!

288
00:14:53,810 --> 00:14:56,020
And this will be
Coco's welcome party!

289
00:14:56,060 --> 00:14:58,480
-Such fun!
-Such food.

290
00:14:58,520 --> 00:15:00,110
♪

291
00:15:06,200 --> 00:15:08,450
Normal meal. Ugh.

292
00:15:08,490 --> 00:15:11,790
Um, Master,
where's the welcome party?

293
00:15:12,290 --> 00:15:13,750
No time to prepare.

294
00:15:13,790 --> 00:15:15,790
We'll just have it
some other day.

295
00:15:16,170 --> 00:15:17,170
Where's Agott?

296
00:15:17,210 --> 00:15:19,210
"I'm eating in my room."

297
00:15:19,250 --> 00:15:20,290
It's her choice,

298
00:15:20,590 --> 00:15:23,260
but I do wish she'd join us
every once in a while.

299
00:15:23,300 --> 00:15:26,180
Now, we don't want it
to get cold, do we?

300
00:15:26,220 --> 00:15:27,590
It's your day, Coco.

301
00:15:27,640 --> 00:15:29,300
Would you bless
the meal for us?

302
00:15:29,350 --> 00:15:31,010
[COCO] Oh! Um...

303
00:15:31,930 --> 00:15:33,810
We're grateful for this food.

304
00:15:33,850 --> 00:15:35,520
[ALL] We're grateful
for this food.

305
00:15:41,650 --> 00:15:42,820
[COCO] Mm...

306
00:15:42,860 --> 00:15:44,240
It's so good.

307
00:15:44,280 --> 00:15:45,740
It is, isn't it?

308
00:15:45,780 --> 00:15:47,700
And we bake it ourselves.

309
00:15:47,740 --> 00:15:49,620
Master's an excellent chef.

310
00:15:49,660 --> 00:15:50,870
He is!

311
00:15:51,120 --> 00:15:53,910
It's the locally grown wheat
that makes the difference.

312
00:15:58,080 --> 00:16:00,080
[Coco exclaims softly]

313
00:16:00,630 --> 00:16:02,210
[exclaims]

314
00:16:02,840 --> 00:16:06,130
This area's vegetables
are of superior quality as well.

315
00:16:06,170 --> 00:16:08,640
-[COCO] Thanks! Delicious!
-Thank you, Master Qifrey!

316
00:16:08,680 --> 00:16:09,930
♪

317
00:16:33,580 --> 00:16:35,750
[COCO] Mom... [sniffles]

318
00:16:42,420 --> 00:16:43,880
[birds chirping]

319
00:16:44,340 --> 00:16:46,510
[COCO] So I need
to take tests of some kind

320
00:16:46,550 --> 00:16:48,630
in order to become
an apprentice.

321
00:16:49,180 --> 00:16:51,800
But it sure would be nice
to get some specifics

322
00:16:51,850 --> 00:16:54,180
on what exactly it is
I have to do.

323
00:16:54,220 --> 00:16:55,890
[QIFREY]
Do about what, exactly?

324
00:16:55,930 --> 00:16:57,680
[Coco gasps]

325
00:16:58,390 --> 00:17:01,770
There's a great deal about magic
you won't find in any book.

326
00:17:01,810 --> 00:17:05,230
Trust me, it's best to learn
by doing. So here.

327
00:17:05,270 --> 00:17:06,900
What are they?

328
00:17:06,940 --> 00:17:08,490
Your components,

329
00:17:08,530 --> 00:17:10,570
tools for drawing magic.

330
00:17:11,660 --> 00:17:13,660
Oh, wow!

331
00:17:13,700 --> 00:17:16,450
Amazing!

332
00:17:16,950 --> 00:17:18,160
[gasps]

333
00:17:18,580 --> 00:17:21,880
A pen, just like the wand.

334
00:17:21,920 --> 00:17:24,460
It still scares me to hold this.

335
00:17:24,500 --> 00:17:25,590
But no...

336
00:17:26,340 --> 00:17:29,720
Mom, I'm going to save you
no matter what!

337
00:17:29,760 --> 00:17:32,760
Please, Master Qifrey,
I'm ready to learn!

338
00:17:32,800 --> 00:17:34,970
Good, let's begin.

339
00:17:41,980 --> 00:17:43,690
[QIFREY]
Are you all right, Coco?

340
00:17:43,730 --> 00:17:45,400
Shall we take a break?

341
00:17:46,230 --> 00:17:48,190
[COCO] No. I'm fine.

342
00:17:49,320 --> 00:17:50,530
Very well.

343
00:17:50,740 --> 00:17:52,860
Why don't you sum up
all that you've learned so far?

344
00:17:52,910 --> 00:17:54,530
Sounds good.

345
00:17:55,160 --> 00:17:57,280
Let's see, to start with,

346
00:17:57,330 --> 00:17:59,450
a spell is composed
of three elements.

347
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:02,250
The sigil lies in the center.

348
00:18:02,620 --> 00:18:05,630
It's surrounded by
markings called signs.

349
00:18:05,670 --> 00:18:08,760
And then, the outer circle
that completes it,

350
00:18:08,800 --> 00:18:10,260
that's called the ring.

351
00:18:10,300 --> 00:18:12,720
The types of sigil are Fire,

352
00:18:13,090 --> 00:18:14,340
Water,

353
00:18:14,970 --> 00:18:16,220
Light,

354
00:18:16,470 --> 00:18:17,810
and Wind.

355
00:18:18,220 --> 00:18:21,230
They determine
what kind of magic it is.

356
00:18:21,520 --> 00:18:25,520
The signs determine what form
the magic ultimately takes,

357
00:18:25,560 --> 00:18:28,360
as well as its size
and direction.

358
00:18:29,780 --> 00:18:33,200
Lastly, when the outer ring
is completed,

359
00:18:33,240 --> 00:18:36,280
that locks the seal in place
and activates the spell.

360
00:18:36,780 --> 00:18:39,410
Memorizing all this is
really taking it out of me.

361
00:18:39,450 --> 00:18:41,620
But you explained it,
that's what counts!

362
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:45,830
Right. I'm going to try
drawing one now!

363
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:48,290
Good for you! That's the spirit!

364
00:18:50,800 --> 00:18:52,840
[Coco sighs]

365
00:18:53,970 --> 00:18:55,510
[Coco sighs]

366
00:18:56,890 --> 00:18:58,970
[Coco exclaims softly]

367
00:19:01,270 --> 00:19:02,480
[QIFREY] Uh?

368
00:19:02,520 --> 00:19:04,060
-[Coco grunts]
-[Qifrey gasps]

369
00:19:04,100 --> 00:19:06,060
-[QIFREY] Don't throw it away.
-[gasps]

370
00:19:06,100 --> 00:19:08,770
No! Please don't look!

371
00:19:08,820 --> 00:19:11,280
It's not even worthy
of your attention!

372
00:19:11,320 --> 00:19:12,690
It's sloppy,

373
00:19:12,820 --> 00:19:15,320
and the lines are all wobbly,
and it's a great big mess.

374
00:19:15,360 --> 00:19:17,200
Of course it is.

375
00:19:17,240 --> 00:19:18,950
You're only just learning.

376
00:19:18,990 --> 00:19:22,240
To that end, here's something
you may want to look at.

377
00:19:22,870 --> 00:19:25,540
See this spot?
Your ring doesn't fully connect.

378
00:19:25,580 --> 00:19:28,840
Unless the circle is complete,
the spell won't activate.

379
00:19:28,880 --> 00:19:30,170
[COCO] Oh.

380
00:19:32,090 --> 00:19:33,970
[QIFREY]
It's natural to be unsteady

381
00:19:34,010 --> 00:19:35,760
when you're getting used
to something new.

382
00:19:35,800 --> 00:19:38,510
You're like a foal
that's just learning to stand.

383
00:19:38,550 --> 00:19:40,100
Don't you worry.

384
00:19:40,140 --> 00:19:42,680
You'll be running wild
in no time at all.

385
00:19:44,270 --> 00:19:48,150
Now, connect the lines,
and activate the spell.

386
00:20:00,870 --> 00:20:02,080
-[Coco screams]
-[Qifrey gasps]

387
00:20:02,120 --> 00:20:03,370
I am so sorry!

388
00:20:03,410 --> 00:20:05,160
It was an accident!
I didn't mean to!

389
00:20:06,370 --> 00:20:08,040
[Coco screams]

390
00:20:08,080 --> 00:20:09,830
[COCO] I am
so, so, so, so sorry.

391
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:12,750
Let me dry it off. [pants]

392
00:20:12,800 --> 00:20:14,510
-Is it working?
-[QIFREY] Settle down, Coco!

393
00:20:14,550 --> 00:20:15,670
Apologies, Agott.

394
00:20:15,720 --> 00:20:16,920
-Are you all right?
-[COCO] Better?

395
00:20:18,630 --> 00:20:20,300
Perfectly fine.

396
00:20:20,340 --> 00:20:22,760
I'm really not bothered
in the least.

397
00:20:23,390 --> 00:20:26,350
But may I ask for a look
at the casting seal she drew?

398
00:20:26,390 --> 00:20:28,310
[QIFREY] Oh, yes.

399
00:20:29,440 --> 00:20:31,480
[AGOTT] Ah, here's the problem.

400
00:20:31,520 --> 00:20:32,860
[Coco exclaims softly]

401
00:20:36,190 --> 00:20:37,490
[AGOTT] Look...

402
00:20:37,530 --> 00:20:40,410
This sign is longer
than the others.

403
00:20:40,450 --> 00:20:43,120
It amplified the pressure
in this direction,

404
00:20:43,160 --> 00:20:45,240
causing the water
to come gushing out.

405
00:20:45,700 --> 00:20:49,330
[QIFREY] Well done!
Astutely observed, as always.

406
00:20:49,540 --> 00:20:50,960
[Qifrey sighs]

407
00:20:51,250 --> 00:20:53,500
Yes, she should be in
very good hands with you.

408
00:20:53,540 --> 00:20:54,630
[COCO] Huh?

409
00:20:59,760 --> 00:21:01,470
For the next few days,

410
00:21:01,510 --> 00:21:04,060
I'm going to be away
visiting the Great Hall.

411
00:21:04,100 --> 00:21:05,100
While I'm gone,

412
00:21:05,140 --> 00:21:07,470
do look after her,
won't you, Agott?

413
00:21:07,520 --> 00:21:09,440
I will. Of course.

414
00:21:09,480 --> 00:21:10,520
[door opens]

415
00:21:10,900 --> 00:21:12,110
Wait! Hold on!

416
00:21:12,150 --> 00:21:14,690
One may learn much indeed
from their peers.

417
00:21:14,730 --> 00:21:17,530
You'll see. Watch her closely
and take it all in.

418
00:21:17,570 --> 00:21:19,030
[Coco gasps]

419
00:21:19,070 --> 00:21:21,530
But, Master, I...

420
00:21:21,910 --> 00:21:23,950
[door closes]

421
00:21:25,490 --> 00:21:28,200
Um, I am sorry
about before. I never--

422
00:21:28,250 --> 00:21:30,500
I said I wasn't bothered,
didn't I?

423
00:21:30,540 --> 00:21:32,330
So you can stop apologizing.

424
00:21:33,790 --> 00:21:36,050
-More importantly...
-[gasps]

425
00:21:36,090 --> 00:21:38,510
I told you to prove yourself,

426
00:21:38,550 --> 00:21:40,300
and I intend to make you.

427
00:21:40,340 --> 00:21:41,340
As of now,

428
00:21:41,380 --> 00:21:43,590
the cushy little lessons
are over.

429
00:21:43,640 --> 00:21:46,350
And your test has begun.

430
00:21:47,310 --> 00:21:48,770
[COCO] What...

431
00:21:52,520 --> 00:21:54,230
♪

432
00:22:06,080 --> 00:22:08,370
[♪ closing theme song playing]

433
00:23:35,410 --> 00:23:39,920
EPISODE 3:
THE DADAH RANGE TEST

